  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unlocking Blue Pacific Prosperity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia will contribute $1.1 million to support a SPC-led co-design process of Unlocking Blue Pacific Prosperity (UBPP). UBPP seeks to use philanthropic and public funds to deliver on its three goals:  (1) conservation and management of 100 percent of the Blue Pacific Continent to maximise benefits for Pacific people; (2) Robust, Resilient Food Systems; and (3) Fit-For-Purpose Sustainable Financing.</narrative>
  </description>
